<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Cleopatra returns at 33 weeks 0 days. The visit and growth scan planned for 29 weeks did not take place: the scan request was not sent when the visit was booked, the visit was cancelled when no scan slot appeared, and neither was rebooked until she called the clinic last week. She has felt well. She has had no headache, visual change, upper abdominal pain, swelling of the face or hands, breathlessness, bleeding, leaking fluid, or regular tightenings; she has occasional painless tightenings in the evening. Both babies move often. She takes aspirin, the prenatal vitamin, and ferrous sulfate every other day. She has stopped evening meetings and plans to stop work at 36 weeks. She had the growth scan this morning and wants to plan the birth. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Missed care</td><td>The 29-week visit and growth scan did not take place</td></tr><tr><td>Symptoms</td><td>None of preeclampsia; occasional painless evening tightenings</td></tr><tr><td>Fetal movement</td><td>Both babies moving often</td></tr><tr><td>Plans</td><td>Stopping work at 36 weeks</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

